title: "retry.py"
---
```python
def fetch(url, times=3):  # (1)
    for attempt in range(times):
        try:
            return get(url)
        except TimeoutError:  # (2)
            sleep(2 ** attempt)
```

1. Three tries.
2. Only timeouts retry.
